msgid ""
"The library folder could not be found. It may have been moved, renamed or "
"deleted, or it may be on a disk that is no longer connected."
msgstr ""
"No se encuentra la carpeta de la biblioteca. Puede que se haya movido, "
"renombrado o eliminado, o que esté en un disco que ya no está conectado."

